  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Scoping mission Impact Cluster on CSWA farming in the Nile Delta</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this project is to contribute to climate and water-smart agriculture in Egypt, by bringing together Dutch providers of agricultural technology, knowledge and services as partner for futureproof farming in the Nile Delta. It follows the recommendations from the study which mapped opportunities for sustainable agriculture in Egypt (PST22EG01) and feeds into the aid-trade combi-trajectory of Egypt.The project should lead to the development of a concrete project proposal for a potential Impact Cluster on CWSA in the Nile Delta, which should be ready for the Impact Cluster application mid 2023.</narrative>
  </description>
